  "title": "TX14",
  "description": "The TX14 dataset comprises neuroimaging recordings collected during a local situational awareness task performed concurrently with supervisory control of a semi-autonomous vehicle. This dataset investigates the cognitive and neural correlates of human-machine interaction in military contexts, specifically examining the trade-offs between maintaining situational awareness and vehicle control during semi-autonomous operations. The data supports research into dynamic task allocation and human factors in autonomous systems.",
